(d) remove, alter or obscure any proprietary notice, Notice File or license text in
the Software;

(e) share your License Key with anyone not entitled to use it under Section 2.5 or
4.4, or publish it; or

(f) use the Software in violation of applicable law.

These restrictions apply only to the Software. Sections 6, 7 and 8 govern the
Separately Licensed Materials, the Open-Source Components and the Models.

